Positive curvature establishes local stability, while a distant
feasible split may still lower the total energy.

26-03
00:20:22.701 --> 00:20:28.909
Inside a fixed tie line, the phase compositions stay fixed and the
amounts change.

26-04
00:20:29.089 --> 00:20:36.257
Equality of chemical potentials gives a candidate, which still needs
feasible amounts and global support.

26-05
00:20:36.437 --> 00:20:45.589
The feed at zero point zero two lies outside the two endpoints, so
their mixture would require a negative phase amount.

26-06
